#  LWR Sample problem

title 'PWR Sample Problem 17x17' /

square /    square problem, not hex
nrow    17   / number of rows of rods along one edge
ppitch  1.26 / rod pitch
apitch 21.54 / assembly pitch

# Material List:  (edit to top of mesh file)
matname  1  "fuel 3.6%"
matname  2  "fuel 4.0%"
matname  3  "fuel 4.6%"
matname  4  "fuel 4.0%" / 3.35% gad
matname  5  clad
matname  6  outer clad
matname  7  water
matcool  7    / coolant material number

# define pin radii and material numbers by ring
pinrad A 0.2 0.418 0.475 /
pinrad B 0.2 0.418 0.475 /
pinrad W 0.2 0.561 0.602 / guide rod

pinmat A 2 2 5 /
pinmat B 1 1 5 /
pinmat W 7 7 5 /  water rod

